ss=\"author-name\">Amazing Service<\/div><div class=\"author-bio\"><span class='author-designation'>Marcus Phelps<\/span><\/div><div class='item-content entry-content'><p>Amazing Service. The process was very easy to sign-up. Daniel at Tailoredpay was on top of his game! He made sure we were taking care of no matter what!<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much! I highly recommended Tailoredpay!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class='rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-12 rt-col-xs-12  tss-grid-item carousel-item no-margin'><div class='single-item-wrapper'><div class='profile-img-wrapper'><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" src=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Group-1135.svg\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"author-name\">High Risk &#8211; No Problem<\/div><div class=\"author-bio\"><span class='author-designation'>Travis Johnson<\/span><\/div><div class='item-content entry-content'><p>I own and operate an online company that is considered &#8220;high risk.\u201dThis was not an obstacle with Tailored Pay. They went above and beyond to provide the best rates with the best acquirers for my business. I definitely recommend any merchant to work with Tailored Pay.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class='rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-12 rt-col-xs-12  tss-grid-item carousel-item no-margin'><div class='single-item-wrapper'><div class='profile-img-wrapper'><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" src=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Group-1135.svg\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"author-name\">Our representative was great he\u2019s very\u2026<\/div><div class=\"author-bio\"><span class='author-designation'>Carlotta H.<\/span><\/div><div class='item-content entry-content'><p>Our representative was great he\u2019s very person centered which made our business experience terrific<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class='rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-12 rt-col-xs-12  tss-grid-item carousel-item no-margin'><div class='single-item-wrapper'><div class='profile-img-wrapper'><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" src=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Group-1135.svg\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"author-name\">Great so far<\/div><div class=\"author-bio\"><span class='author-designation'>Wayne H.<\/span><\/div><div class='item-content entry-content'><p>Great so far. Processing is working well and my representative is very helpful and surprisingly responsive.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class='rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-12 rt-col-xs-12  tss-grid-item carousel-item no-margin'><div class='single-item-wrapper'><div class='profile-img-wrapper'><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" src=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Group-1135.svg\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"author-name\">Communication was great and they\u2026<\/div><div class=\"author-bio\"><span class='author-designation'>Leonard<\/span><\/div><div class='item-content entry-content'><p>Communication was great and they offered the lowest rate for our industry. I was talking to many different providers but TailoredPay offered many incentives, I do not regret it. Highly recommending using TailoredPay!!<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><div class='rt-col-md-12 rt-col-sm-12 rt-col-xs-12  tss-grid-item carousel-item no-margin'><div class='single-item-wrapper'><div class='profile-img-wrapper'><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"108\" height=\"20\" src=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/03\/Group-1135.svg\" class=\"rt-responsive-img\" alt=\"\" \/><\/div><div class=\"item-content-wrapper\"><div class=\"author-name\">Great Company easy communication and\u2026<\/div><div class=\"author-bio\"><span class='author-designation'>Amer<\/span><\/div><div class='item-content entry-content'><p>Great Company easy communication and great rates<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-3{width:66.666666666667% !important;margin-top : 0px;margin-bottom : 0px;}.fusion-builder-column-3 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-top : 0px !important;padding-right : 0px !important;margin-right : 0;padding-bottom : 0px !important;padding-left : 0px !important;margin-left : 0;}@media only screen and (max-width:992px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-3{width:75% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-column-3 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-right : 50px !important;margin-right : 0;padding-left : 50px !important;margin-left : 0;}}@media only screen and (max-width:670px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-3{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-column-3 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-right : 0 !important;margin-right : 1.92%;padding-left : 0 !important;margin-left : 1.92%;}}<\/style><\/div>\n<\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-flex-container.fusion-builder-row-2{ padding-top : 30px;margin-top : 0px;padding-right : 0px;padding-bottom : 0px;margin-bottom : 0px;padding-left : 0px;}<\/style><\/div><div class=\"fusion-fullwidth fullwidth-box fusion-builder-row-3 fusion-flex-container nonhundred-percent-fullwidth non-hundred-percent-height-scrolling\" style=\"background-color: rgba(255,255,255,0);background-position: center center;background-repeat: no-repeat;border-width: 0px 0px 0px 0px;border-color:#e2e2e2;border-style:solid;\" id=\"sticky-sidebar-container\" ><div class=\"fusion-builder-row fusion-row fusion-flex-align-items-flex-start fusion-flex-justify-content-center\" style=\"max-width:1216.8px;margin-left: calc(-4% \/ 2 );margin-right: calc(-4% \/ 2 );\"><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-4 fusion_builder_column_1_1 1_1 fusion-flex-column decorate-column decorate-column-2 decorate-column-industry-page\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\" style=\"background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-4{width:100% !important;margin-top : 0px;margin-bottom : 20px;}.fusion-builder-column-4 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-top : 0px !important;padding-right : 0px !important;margin-right : 1.92%;padding-bottom : 0px !important;padding-left : 0px !important;margin-left : 1.92%;}@media only screen and (max-width:992px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-4{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-column-4 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}@media only screen and (max-width:670px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-4{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-column-4 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}<\/style><\/div><div class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-5 fusion_builder_column_2_3 2_3 fusion-flex-column\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\" style=\"background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-text fusion-text-4\"><div class=\"wpb_text_column wpb_content_element vc_custom_1610562965139 para-black\">\n<div class=\"wpb_wrapper\">\n<p>Ecommerce is a growing industry in the US, with total ecommerce sales expected to reach around\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.insiderintelligence.com\/content\/us-ecommerce-2020\">709 billion dollars in 2020<\/a>\u00a0(up 18% from 2019). Ecommerce covers a wide range of products, satisfying almost every industry imaginable, and each sale requires some form of ecommerce payment processing.<\/p>\n<p>Depending on your industry and current financial status, you may be considered too high-risk to be approved for an ecommerce merchant account. In some instances, even if you are approved, your credit card processing fees will be raised in order for banks and payment processors to negate the risk. This is why many consider working with a provider that specializes in\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/high-risk-merchant-account\/\">high risk merchant accounts<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>A high risk payment processor helps companies operating in industries that are deemed high risk, such as\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/adult-merchant-accounts\">adult<\/a>,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/collection-agency-merchant-accounts\/\">debt collection<\/a>,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/cbd-payment-processing\/\">CBD<\/a>, and\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/nutraceutical-merchant-accounts\/\">nutraceutical<\/a>, securely handle all of their credit card and debit card payments, while relaying payment information to both the customer\u2019s issuing bank, as well as the acquiring institutions. Because ecommerce merchant accounts rely solely on online payments, it is imperative to choose a quality ecommerce credit card processor that won\u2019t take advantage of you or your financial situation.<\/p>\n<p>You can think of payment processors as the middleman, connecting merchants, customers, and financial institutions to ensure all payment transaction information is accurate and timely. Ecommerce credit card processors will facilitate the transfer of these funds, but there is usually a cap on the amount they will process within a given time period (e.g.: $50,000 limit in a 30 day period).<\/p>\n<p>Ecommerce payment processors are highly selective of the merchants they work with, and will often deny merchants for payment processing services because of their business credit, the type of industry they serve, high chargeback ratios, and other factors. For this reason, many merchants labeled high-risk accept much higher ecommerce credit card processing fees.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"color--primary\">Payment Gateways for Ecommerce Merchant Accounts<\/h2>\n<p>Payment gateways act as a facilitator between a payment portal (like a website, mobile phone, or interactive voice response service) and the front end processor or acquiring bank, transferring the payment information from one party to the other.\u00a0 All payment processors use a payment gateway via their own technology, or a third party source.<\/p>\n<p>When choosing a payment gateway, it is imperative to think about customer experience. Getting a customer to select your product out of the countless alternatives is the hard part; the payment process should be effortless. If you use a payment gateway that is frustrating or difficult to navigate, the customer may abandon payment altogether. This could lead to a loss of potential sales, as well as a higher\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/chargeback-mitigation\/\">chargeback ratio<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>At TailoredPay, our\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/tailoredpay.com\/payment-gateways\/\">secure payment gateways<\/a>\u00a0seamlessly integrate with platforms such as\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.shopify.com\/\">Shopify<\/a>, Woocommerce, Wix, and more to provide an easy payment experience for your online customers. This allows you to finalize sales in a matter of seconds, while also protecting your customer\u2019s financial data through encryption.<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"color--primary\">TailoredPay Ecommerce Merchant Accounts<\/h2>\n<p>At TailoredPay, we specialize in ecommerce merchant accounts that are considered high risk.\u00a0To apply for a merchant account, you will have to provide us with some information about your business, for example:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>The type of industry you serve<\/li>\n<li>Payment processing history (if you are currently processing credit\/debit card payments)<\/li>\n<li>Anticipated monthly processing volume<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>TailoredPay works with merchants that are labelled as high-risk to provide payment solutions for ecommerce websites in a multitude of industries. We can provide you with a merchant account for your business, and process the payments via our secure payments gateways. If you are seeking an ecommerce merchant account, but have been told you are too high-risk to be approved, contact TailoredPay to discuss the right credit card processing solution for your ecommerce business.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><style type=\"text\/css\">.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-5{width:66.666666666667% !important;margin-top : 0px;margin-bottom : 20px;}.fusion-builder-column-5 > .fusion-column-wrapper {padding-top : 0px !important;padding-right : 0px !important;margin-right : 2.88%;padding-bottom : 0px !important;padding-left : 0px !important;margin-left : 2.88%;}@media only screen and (max-width:992px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-5{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-column-5 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}@media only screen and (max-width:670px) {.fusion-body .fusion-builder-column-5{width:100% !important;order : 0;}.fusion-builder-column-5 > .fusion-column-wrapper {margin-right : 1.92%;margin-left : 1.92%;}}<\/style><\/div><aside class=\"fusion-layout-column fusion_builder_column fusion-builder-column-6 fusion_builder_column_1_3 1_3 fusion-flex-column\" id=\"sticky-sidebar\"><div class=\"fusion-column-wrapper fusion-flex-justify-content-flex-start fusion-content-layout-column\" style=\"background-position:left top;background-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-background-size:cover;-moz-background-size:cover;-o-background-size:cover;background-size:cover;background-color:#ffffff;padding: 0px 0px 0px 0px;\"><div class=\"fusion-b